                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.679 Residence and Establishment/74:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-28T17:00:00+02:00">October 28, 1931—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 28—12:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>9. Treaty of establishment and residence signed today. No alterations, no
                    procès-verbal.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
